      "status_terms_zh": [],
      "summary_en": "Sett passively stores damage he takes as Grit. On cast, Sett expends all stored Grit to gain a shield and punch an area, dealing true damage in the center and physical damage on the sides.",
      "summary_zh": "瑟提会被动地将他受到的伤害储存为豪意。在施放时，瑟提会释放所有已储存的豪意来提供一层护盾并且重击一个区域，在区域中心造成真实伤害并在区域边缘造成物理伤害。",
      "wiki_source_ref_ids": [
        "source:wiki:1415955:4008036"
      ]
